{"ID":"20240314094743-v9llr2v","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314094743-v9llr2v","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314094743-v9llr2v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171602-avgmrxc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171602-8omqhw2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:167,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171602-8omqhw2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:212,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:212\u0026#125;","title":"【大黄甘遂汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171602"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171602-avgmrxc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171602-avgmrxc","updated":"20240422171602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人少腹满如敦状，小便微难而不渴，生后者，此为水舆血俱结在血室也，大黄甘遂汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171602-0jremsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171602-0jremsv","updated":"20240422171602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄甘遂汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171602-dvr3uet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171602-dvr3uet","updated":"20240422171602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄四两甘遂阿胶各二两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171602-9kpxrr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171602-9kpxrr0","updated":"20240422171602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水三升，煑取一升，顿服，其血当下。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171602-3flh3kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171602-3flh3kq","updated":"20240422171602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这一个处方呢，大概只有我用过。那“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"少腹满如敦"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，这个敦是什么意思啊？蹲在厕所上？不是哦。“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便微难而不渴，生后者，此为水与学俱结在血室也"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，过去大家读过，血如果停在...这个跌打损伤，血停在膀胱里面，我们不是有桃核承气汤吗？诸如此类的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171602-gfqoeh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171602-gfqoeh0","updated":"20240422171602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240416111218-j0m5bd3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422171602-1oihjlc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171602-1oihjlc","updated":"20240422171602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"什么叫做水与血俱结在血室？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个，我先画个太太小姐，这种身材可以穿比基尼，对不对？她不是这样子啊，她侧面看啊，本来侧面看是这样子，我们画一个可以穿比基尼的身材，她侧面看不是这样子，侧面看的时候，什么地方都不凸就是凸肚子，都好好的也没有怀孕，然后她来找你就是不孕。“哎呀医生那，我结婚 6 年小孩没有，想生小孩”。我看看你肚子，你隔着衣服都看到她鼓起来，她说我什么毛病都没有，就是这个地方膨起来一块，这叫做少腹如敦，敦就好像一个鼎卡在里面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"原因是什么？原因是水加血结在子宫里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，造成这样子。像比如说我们吃的当归芍药散...如果你只是水在子宫里面，月经来的时候颜色比较淡，因为水跟血会混在一起，可是现在不单单是水，还有瘀血块在子宫里面堵到。那你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"要设计一个处方，同时把水和血排掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。结果这个病人我一看，大黄甘遂汤证，给她一剂 8 颗，就胶囊啊，因为里面很辣嘛（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"药粉很辣？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）...吃完人就不见了，没有消息了，奇怪怎么就没有消息了呢？结果第二个月呢跑来，怀孕了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171602-dp1ywuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171602-dp1ywuq","updated":"20240422171602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我说你吃完药怎么不跟我讲？她说很好啊！可是那个药不要再给我吃了，所以我不回来了。我说为什么不要吃了？她说，倪大夫你不晓得吃那个药多难过，我吃下去哦，我这样子形容，在走道，我要去上厕所，急得要上厕所，可是头又晕，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中病！因为药不瞑眩厥疾弗瘳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，她说我就扶着两面墙晃着走，然后到那边去吐了很多，泄了很多，拉出来全部是黑血，黑的水和血，拉大便拉出来哦，不是从子宫出来，不是从阴道出来。然后呢，排出来很好啊，可是当时很难过对不对？吓死了，走路都不能走了，所以我心里想吃这一次就够了嘛，回去的话你再给我吃一剂那还得了？所以我就不回来了，但吃完你的药很好啊，肚子平了，我可以穿比基尼呀，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"结果第二个月就怀孕了。你看厉不厉害，而且不是一个，好几个都这样子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以这个血结胞门，看起来就像...而且这个腹部，肿起来硬邦邦的，一个硬硬的，你摸表面上又不是肿瘤，你一拍，里面好像西瓜，不应该讲西瓜，好像篮球，嘭嘭嘭，还有回音的，那如果是西瓜是实的嘛，她里面是空的，这就是有水在里面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这是唯一处方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！"}]},{"ID":"20240422171602-eo3kclr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171602-eo3kclr","updated":"20240422171602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你说遇到这个病，换一个处方，什么用都没有。这个大黄是 1/2，这个甘遂是 1/4，这个阿胶是 1/4，这是比例，所以说如果三个加起来，正好是一钱的量。一钱的量呢，中间1/2 是大黄，甘遂和阿胶各占 1/4，这是基本上的处方比例。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171602-8omqhw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171602-8omqhw2","updated":"20240422171602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你去煮的时候，这个是用水三升去煮，实际上不用，你用粉剂也可以，放到胶囊里面。你如果说，老师我要用汤剂，可以啊！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄 3钱，甘遂一钱，阿胶一钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这样就可以了，3 碗水煮成一碗喝下去，也可以。一般来说我们用粉剂就够了，我放到胶囊里面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一剂就中"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那这种处方给病人吃的时候，记得，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就给她一付就好了，不要给她第二付"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，好不好？不要给她第二付，免得...你怎么知道你的病人想什么，所以说很可怕，病人很可怕，我到时讲案例的时候你就知道了。"}]}]}